{"id":"000W7T","title":"United Regions","author":"fnin","solvedCount":0,"difficulty":4,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-24T23:03:46+00:00","posted":"Gestern, 21:57 Uhr","rules":"United Regions\n\nRules:\n\n1. Standard placement: The digits from 1 to 8 are placed so that each appears exactly once in every row and every column.\n\n2. Division into teams: The digits 1 to 8 are divided into two teams, with each digit assigned to exactly one team.\n\n3. Unique regions: The final grid is fully partitioned into regions of orthogonally connected cells (a region may consist of a single cell). Each region is built from digits belonging to a single team, and orthogonally adjacent regions belong to opposite teams. Digits do not repeat within a region. All regions are unique in their composition of digits.\n\n4. Islands: All regions of the same size must form one orthogonally connected island.\n\n5. Some region borders have been given.\n\n6. The three cells marked with circles belong to one region.\n\nplay on SudokuPad\n\nsee also: Battle for territory\n\nBuild Different Regions\n\nUnique Yet Equal","solutionCode":"Enter Row 4 digits.","tags":["Sudoku"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/pw7q9wmlm1","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/pw7q9wmlm1","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":8,"cols":8,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-24T23:03:46+00:00"}